<details class="statement-examples" data-statement-id="examples" open><summary>Contoh dokumen &amp; panduan unggah</summary><p class="hint">Unduh contoh, ubah isinya di Word atau editor aplikasi, lalu unggah sebagai template baru.</p><div class="toolbar"><a class="button" href="/api/statements/examples/basic">Contoh template dasar</a><a class="button" href="/api/statements/examples/benturan">Contoh Benturan Kepentingan</a><a class="button" href="/api/statements/examples/etika">Contoh Kode Etik</a><a class="button" href="/api/statements/examples/integritas">Contoh Pakta Integritas</a></div><p class="hint">Gunakan file .docx. Batas ukuran mengikuti Edit dokumen Word pada Website Setting (default 50 MB). Placeholder harus sesuai kunci field, misalnya <code>{{nama}}</code>, <code>{{nip}}</code>, <code>{{jabatan}}</code>, <code>{{tempat}}</code>, <code>{{tanggal}}</code>, dan <code>{{tanda_tangan}}</code>.</p><p class="hint">Untuk isian tambahan, buat field dengan kunci yang sama di pengaturan. Template baru disimpan sebagai draf sampai Anda mengaktifkan tautan publik.</p></details><section id="statementAdmintemplatesPanel" data-statement-id="templatesPanel" class="card"><h2>Template surat</h2><p class="muted">Gunakan dokumen Word sebagai sumber format. Field yang Anda atur di sini muncul di formulir publik.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Jenis &amp; template</th><th>Field publik</th><th>Status</th><th>Tautan publik</th><th>Kelola</th></tr></thead><tbody id="statementAdmintypes" data-statement-id="types"></tbody></table></div><div class="toolbar"><label>Baris per halaman<select data-statement-id="typePageSize"><option>10</option><option selected>25</option><option>50</option></select></label><button data-statement-id="typePrevious" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="typePageInfo"></span><button data-statement-id="typeNext" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div></section>
<section data-statement-id="monitoringPanel" class="card" hidden><h2>Dashboard Monitoring</h2><form data-statement-id="monitoringForm" class="toolbar"><label>Tahun penugasan<input data-statement-id="monitoringYear" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" required></label><button class="primary">Perbarui monitoring</button></form><p class="hint">Monitoring mengikuti penugasan setiap karyawan pada tahun pilihan, termasuk karyawan nonaktif. Pengisian ulang tidak menambah jumlah penugasan selesai.</p><p data-statement-id="monitoringStatus" role="status"></p><div data-statement-id="monitoringCards" class="stats"></div><h3>Progres pengisian surat</h3><div data-statement-id="monitoringProgress"></div><h3>Monitoring per jenis surat</h3><div data-statement-id="monitoringTypes" style="overflow-x:auto"></div><div class="toolbar"><button data-statement-id="monitoringTypesPrevious" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="monitoringTypesPage"></span><button data-statement-id="monitoringTypesNext" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div><h3>Monitoring per departemen</h3><div data-statement-id="monitoringDepartments" style="overflow-x:auto"></div><div class="toolbar"><button data-statement-id="monitoringDepartmentsPrevious" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="monitoringDepartmentsPage"></span><button data-statement-id="monitoringDepartmentsNext" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div></section>
<section data-statement-id="employeesPanel" class="card" hidden><h2>Karyawan</h2><div class="toolbar"><button data-statement-id="employeeAdd" type="button" class="primary">Tambah karyawan</button><a href="/api/statements/employees/template" class="button">Unduh template Excel karyawan</a><a href="/surat-pernyataan" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="button">Buka portal karyawan</a></div><p class="hint">Admin wajib menetapkan password baru sebelum karyawan dapat masuk. Impor ulang memperbarui profil tanpa mereset password lama. Kolom NIP di Excel harus berformat TEXT agar nol awal tetap tersimpan.</p><form data-statement-id="employeeImportForm" class="toolbar"><label>Impor karyawan (.xlsx, maksimum 5 MB)<input data-statement-id="employeeFile" type="file" accept=".xlsx" required></label><button class="primary">Pratinjau impor</button></form><form data-statement-id="employeeSearchForm" class="toolbar"><label>Tahun penugasan<input data-statement-id="employeeProgressYear" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" required></label><label>Cari NIP / nama<input data-statement-id="employeeSearch" type="search" maxlength="160"></label><label>Departemen<select data-statement-id="employeeDepartment"></select></label><button>Terapkan</button></form><p class="hint">Jumlah surat mengikuti penugasan setiap karyawan pada tahun pilihan. Pengisian ulang menambah total pengisian, tetapi satu penugasan tetap dihitung satu kali selesai.</p><p data-statement-id="employeeCount" role="status"></p><div class="toolbar"><label class="check"><input data-statement-id="employeeSelectAll" type="checkbox">Pilih semua hasil filter (semua halaman)</label><button data-statement-id="employeeClearSelection" type="button">Hapus pilihan</button><button data-statement-id="employeeBulkPassword" type="button">Ubah password pegawai terpilih</button><button data-statement-id="employeeAllPasswords" type="button">Ubah password semua pegawai</button></div><p data-statement-id="employeeSelected" role="status"></p><div data-statement-id="employeeTable" style="overflow-x:auto"></div><div class="toolbar"><button data-statement-id="employeePrevious" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="employeePageInfo"></span><button data-statement-id="employeeNext" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div><section data-statement-id="assignmentCreator" class="editor-block"><h3>Tugaskan surat kepada pegawai terpilih</h3><form data-statement-id="assignmentForm"><label>Tahun penugasan<input data-statement-id="assignmentYear" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" required></label><div data-statement-id="assignmentTypes" class="grid"></div><button class="primary">Simpan penugasan</button></form></section></section>
<section data-statement-id="assignmentsPanel" class="card" hidden><h2>Penugasan tahunan</h2><form data-statement-id="assignmentSearchForm" class="toolbar"><label>Tahun penugasan<input data-statement-id="assignmentFilterYear" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" required></label><label>Cari NIP / nama<input data-statement-id="assignmentSearch" type="search" maxlength="160"></label><label>Departemen<select data-statement-id="assignmentDepartment"></select></label><label>Status<select data-statement-id="assignmentStatus"><option value="">Semua status</option><option value="done">Sudah diisi</option><option value="pending">Belum diisi</option></select></label><button class="primary">Terapkan</button></form><p class="hint">Penugasan menentukan surat yang dapat diakses karyawan di portal publik. Tahun penugasan tersimpan pada hasil pengisian. Pencabutan penugasan tidak menghapus surat yang telah dikirim.</p><p data-statement-id="assignmentCount" role="status"></p><div data-statement-id="assignmentTable" style="overflow-x:auto"></div><div class="toolbar"><button data-statement-id="assignmentPrevious" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="assignmentPageInfo"></span><button data-statement-id="assignmentNext" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div></section>
<dialog data-statement-id="employeeImportDialog" class="editor-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>Pratinjau impor karyawan</h2><button data-statement-id="employeeImportClose" type="button">Tutup</button></div><p data-statement-id="employeeImportCount"></p><p class="hint">Periksa NIP sebelum menyimpan. NIP yang sudah terdaftar diperbarui profilnya; password tetap dipertahankan.</p><div data-statement-id="employeeImportPreview" style="overflow-x:auto;max-height:50vh"></div><div class="toolbar"><button data-statement-id="importPrevious" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="importPageInfo"></span><button data-statement-id="importNext" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div><button data-statement-id="employeeImportConfirm" class="primary" type="button">Simpan impor karyawan</button></dialog>
<dialog data-statement-id="employeeProgressDialog" class="editor-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>Penugasan surat karyawan</h2><button data-statement-id="employeeProgressClose" type="button">Tutup</button></div><p data-statement-id="employeeProgressMeta" data-no-translate></p><p data-statement-id="employeeProgressStatus" role="status"></p><div data-statement-id="employeeProgressTable" style="overflow-x:auto"></div><div class="toolbar"><button data-statement-id="employeeProgressPrevious" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="employeeProgressPageInfo"></span><button data-statement-id="employeeProgressNext" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div></dialog>
<dialog data-statement-id="employeeDialog" class="editor-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2 data-statement-id="employeeDialogTitle">Kelola karyawan</h2><button data-statement-id="employeeClose" type="button">Tutup</button></div><form data-statement-id="employeeForm"><div class="grid"><label>NIP<input name="nip" readonly required maxlength="72" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9._\/\-]+"></label><label>Nama lengkap<input name="name" required maxlength="250"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="250"></label><label>Departemen<input name="department" maxlength="250"></label><label>Jabatan<input name="position" maxlength="250"></label><label>Status pekerja<select name="status"><option value="">Pilih...</option><option>Tetap</option><option>Kontrak</option><option>Outsource</option></select></label><label>Penyedia jasa tenaga kerja<input name="provider" maxlength="250"></label><label class="check"><input name="active" type="checkbox">Karyawan aktif</label></div><p data-statement-id="employeeError" role="alert" class="error-text"></p><button class="primary">Simpan profil</button></form></dialog>
<dialog data-statement-id="passwordDialog" class="editor-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>Ubah password pegawai</h2><button data-statement-id="passwordClose" type="button">Tutup</button></div><p data-statement-id="passwordScope" data-no-translate></p><form data-statement-id="passwordForm"><label>Metode password<select name="mode"><option value="custom">Gunakan satu password baru</option></select></label><label data-statement-id="passwordCustom">Password baru<input name="password" type="password" minlength="8" maxlength="72" autocomplete="new-password"></label><p class="hint">Hanya admin yang dapat mengubah password. Semua sesi portal pegawai terpilih akan diakhiri. Maksimum 500 pegawai untuk pilihan tertentu. Aksi semua pegawai mencakup seluruh karyawan terdaftar, termasuk yang nonaktif.</p><p data-statement-id="passwordError" role="alert" class="error-text"></p><button class="primary">Terapkan perubahan password</button></form></dialog>
<section data-statement-id="recapPanel" class="card" hidden><h2>Rekap NIP &amp; Tahun</h2><div class="toolbar"><label>Tahun ekspor<input data-statement-id="exportYear" type="number" min="2000" max="2100"></label><label>Dasar tahun ekspor<select data-statement-id="exportBasis"><option value="input">Tahun input</option><option value="assignment">Tahun penugasan</option></select></label><button data-statement-id="exportFilled" type="button">Ekspor daftar pengisian Excel</button><button data-statement-id="exportDocuments" type="button">Ekspor seluruh surat ZIP</button></div><p class="hint">Ekspor mencakup seluruh pegawai pada tahun pilihan, termasuk semua pengisian ulang. ZIP berisi dokumen Word asli yang sudah ditandatangani.</p><form data-statement-id="recapForm" class="toolbar"><label>Cari NIP / nama<input data-statement-id="recapSearch" type="search" maxlength="160"></label><label>Tahun input<select data-statement-id="recapYear"><option value="">Semua tahun</option></select></label><button class="primary">Terapkan</button></form><p class="hint">Kelengkapan dihitung dari jenis surat yang saat ini aktif. Pengisian berulang untuk jenis surat yang sama dihitung satu dokumen per tahun.</p><p data-statement-id="recapCount" role="status"></p><div data-statement-id="recapTable" style="overflow-x:auto"></div><div class="toolbar"><button data-statement-id="recapPrevious" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="recapPageInfo"></span><button data-statement-id="recapNext" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div></section>
<section id="statementAdminhistoryPanel" data-statement-id="historyPanel" class="card" hidden><h2>Data masuk</h2><form id="statementAdminsearchForm" data-statement-id="searchForm" class="toolbar"><label>Cari seluruh field<input id="statementAdminsearch" data-statement-id="search" type="search" maxlength="160"></label><label>Jenis surat<select data-statement-id="filterType"></select></label><label>Filter field<select data-statement-id="filterField"></select></label><label>Pencocokan<select data-statement-id="filterMatch"><option value="contains">Mengandung</option><option value="exact">Sama persis</option></select></label><label>Nilai filter<input data-statement-id="filterValue" maxlength="500"></label><label>Kelompokkan berdasarkan<select data-statement-id="groupField"></select></label><button class="primary">Terapkan</button><button type="button" data-statement-id="resetFilters">Atur ulang</button></form><p class="muted">Pilih field kustom untuk memfilter atau mengelompokkan data. Setiap kelompok menampilkan maksimal 100 surat terbaru.</p><p data-statement-id="resultCount" role="status"></p><div id="statementAdmingroups" data-statement-id="groups" style="overflow-x:auto"></div><div class="toolbar"><button type="button" data-statement-id="previousPage">Sebelumnya</button><span data-statement-id="pageInfo"></span><button type="button" data-statement-id="nextPage">Berikutnya</button></div></section>
<dialog id="statementAdmineditor" data-statement-id="editor" class="editor-dialog"><form id="statementAdmintypeForm" data-statement-id="typeForm"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><small class="eyebrow">PENGATURAN SURAT</small><h2 id="statementAdmineditorTitle" data-statement-id="editorTitle">Buat jenis surat</h2></div><button type="button" id="statementAdmincloseEditor" data-statement-id="closeEditor">Tutup</button></div><input name="id" type="hidden"><label>Nama jenis surat<input name="title" maxlength="250" required></label>
<div class="editor-block"><h3>1. Template &amp; format Word</h3><label id="statementAdminsourceLabel" data-statement-id="sourceLabel">Gunakan template yang sudah ada<select name="sourceTypeId"><option value="">Buat dari teks / unggah Word baru</option></select></label><p id="statementAdmincurrentDocument" data-statement-id="currentDocument" class="muted"></p><p class="hint"><a href="/api/statements/examples/basic">Unduh contoh template Word siap isi</a></p><label>Unggah template Word (.docx; batas mengikuti Website Setting)<input type="file" id="statementAdmindocumentFile" data-statement-id="documentFile" accept=".docx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"></label><p class="hint">Format, kop, tabel, penomoran, dan margin mengikuti file Word. Gunakan placeholder seperti <code>{{nama}}</code>, <code>{{nip}}</code>, dan <code>{{tanda_tangan}}</code> di dalam file. Tanda tangan pada tiga contoh sudah ditempatkan sesuai dokumen asli.</p><details id="statementAdmintextMode" data-statement-id="textMode"><summary>Isi surat berbasis teks</summary><p class="muted">Dipakai bila tidak memilih atau mengunggah template Word.</p><label>Isi surat<textarea name="body" maxlength="60000"></textarea></label></details></div>
<div class="editor-block"><div class="toolbar"><h3>2. Field yang boleh diisi publik</h3><button id="statementAdminaddField" data-statement-id="addField" type="button">+ Tambah field</button><button data-statement-id="addDepartment" type="button">Tambah field Departemen</button></div><p class="hint">Nama dan NIP digunakan sebagai identitas pengisi. Field lain bisa diatur agar boleh diisi publik, memakai nilai tetap dari petugas, atau diubah menjadi pilihan/tanggal. Field tanda tangan tersedia di formulir.</p><div id="statementAdminfieldRows" data-statement-id="fieldRows"></div></div>
<div class="editor-block"><h3>3. Publikasi</h3><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="active" checked><span>Aktifkan pengisian publik tanpa login</span></label><p class="hint">Menonaktifkan tautan tidak menghapus surat yang sudah masuk.</p></div><p id="statementAdmineditorError" data-statement-id="editorError" role="alert" class="error-text"></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="primary" id="statementAdminsaveType" data-statement-id="saveType">Simpan pengaturan</button></div></form></dialog>
<dialog id="statementAdmintemplatePreview" data-statement-id="templatePreview" class="preview-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2 id="statementAdmintemplatePreviewTitle" data-statement-id="templatePreviewTitle">Pratinjau template</h2><button id="statementAdminclosePreview" data-statement-id="closePreview">Tutup</button></div><p class="hint">Pratinjau browser. Unduh Word untuk membuka format sumber di Microsoft Word.</p><div id="statementAdmintemplateFieldList" data-statement-id="templateFieldList" class="field-chips"></div><p><a id="statementAdmintemplateDownload" data-statement-id="templateDownload" class="button">Unduh template Word</a></p><div id="statementAdmintemplatePaper" data-statement-id="templatePaper" class="word-preview"></div></dialog>
<dialog id="statementAdmindetail" data-statement-id="detail" class="preview-dialog"><div class="toolbar no-print"><a id="statementAdmindetailDownload" data-statement-id="detailDownload" class="button">Unduh surat Word</a><button id="statementAdminprint" data-statement-id="print">Cetak / simpan PDF</button><button data-statement-id="deleteSubmission" type="button" hidden>Hapus surat</button><button id="statementAdmincloseDetail" data-statement-id="closeDetail">Tutup</button></div><p data-statement-id="deleteSubmissionStatus" role="alert" class="error-text"></p><h2 id="statementAdmindetailTitle" data-statement-id="detailTitle"></h2><p id="statementAdmindetailMeta" data-statement-id="detailMeta" class="muted"></p><dl id="statementAdmindetailFields" data-statement-id="detailFields" class="identity-list"></dl><div id="statementAdmindetailPaper" data-statement-id="detailPaper" class="word-preview"></div><article id="statementAdmindetailBody" data-statement-id="detailBody" data-no-translate class="document" hidden></article><small id="statementAdmindetailHash" data-statement-id="detailHash"></small></dialog>

  </section>
</div>
</template>
